    "finding": "The squared-eigenvalue ratios are μ/e = 206.770316 and τ/e = 3477.472837. The comparison-only muon residual is +9.83213 ppm. Two shape parameters have a nonsingular ratio Jacobian; common normalization cancels. Independence of the two prepared cells fixes the phase 2/9. No phase or round count is fitted here. The mass-read double-load effect has trace 5/18, a common factor 5/4 above the separate native-pair effect; their ratios coincide. A physical pole-mass interpretation is an additional premise."
